<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-30T08:49:36.097Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:49:36 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russian Su-35 fighter jets and S-400 air defence systems have arrived in Ethiopia as fighting spreads across Tigray, Amhara and Oromia, with drone strikes hitting an IDP camp in Amhara and a shelter in South Wollo, causing civilian casualties. Militant attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in Oromia, while drone strikes in Amhara killed 14, including children. Thousands of people are fleeing the border clashes, with about 50,000 refugees arriving in Moyale, Kenya. The conflict has also seen Ethiopia begin homegrown drone manufacturing. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNSkU4SzhYN29pZDRCa01XMHJkbklLa2pKMkVya2Rqd3p2eGlHb2tBM3V6RThNcFJFbldYNEo4MC1QTXNTcVhDOFFWQ09uTWdtbGVkOW5RaW1tZ1JmQ1NKWjY4ZV9Ob2dfcUloM2Q1THVxV2w5RnpZYkpqRVBlSlFRbA?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFB2dUtyeUs4eU9CLWoxWGIyQkVXd045YUxiR2V5blloTkdyYm9PdXZ2RDItZ1hUdmE2OXp0cEN1d0ZaMlBRaGFXLXBwUklYYkJITnNsZzgzUF9falplbVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Oz Arab Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNZFNJYml2ams2SWxGZ2lSYnhDajFkcW1kN21IM05MTFZmU3JSLWplT1hiWjlva19fTTdXcGNOWFNxaWxwUmstMWVUckptb1JIRnhUdnB4bXAtREpVYU1WOXlwTFFHQ3Vkd1R2VWlOR1JwSGtlTDRhcVpWQVZLYnI4UmRzLUlKZ2lkUkd4OGdKNVVGRkJJbWQ0c0dmZzkyazM2QkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOY1Zvbjh4ZXVaSFF6ZXZoYS1DNVVtX0FUVVE1NDBDRjQ4UC1fWGRINjFjRnl0TmRHOXNLQjlfREpTVFZYb3lka0ZBVEo4a0